Build presets are shared mechanics used by every workspace package.

# decision GeneratedRelease

`presets/typescript/release.ts` creates publishable package metadata and the top-level release task rebuilds `release/`. Treat that directory as disposable generated output and never patch it directly.

# invariant WorkspaceConsistency

Package test, lint, release, and publish targets follow the shared make and TypeScript presets so local runs and GitHub Actions execute the same pipeline.
